type: software
title: "nbpearson: explicit negative-binomial Pearson-residual linear operators"
version: 0.1.0.dev1
authors:
  - family-names: Kone
    given-names: Mohamed
abstract: >-
  Python CPU/binary64 operators with explicit interpolated,
  interpolated-grouped and exact-grouped representations of a fixed
  negative-binomial Pearson-residual target. Software attribution follows
  the investigator-supplied Software contribution of Mohamed Kone.
  Original code uses MIT with Copyright (c) 2026 Mohamed Kone, based on
  his explicit ownership and distribution-authority assertion. No public
  release, tag or DOI is asserted by this candidate.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mohkone/nbpearson"
keywords:
  - sparse counts
  - Pearson residuals
  - negative binomial
  - linear operators
